title: Free Worlds Defence Pact
subtitle: Build loyal defence forces among member worlds, under civilian control.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_pact.svg
view-if: pact_timer <= 0 and (senate_resolve >= 3 or pact_formed) and cardok_pact
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; pact_timer = 3; last_card_timer = "pact"
new-page: true

= Free Worlds Defence Pact

[? if not pact_formed : The Republic has had no army for a thousand years. But Alderaan, Corellia, Chandrila and others still keep their own security forces. A mutual Defence Pact, answerable to their own elected governments and to no Chancellor, would mean the Senate is never defenceless. ?][? if pact_formed : The Free Worlds Defence Pact stands. Its member-world forces are currently [+ member_forces : strength +]. ?]

- @form: Found the Pact.
- @train: Train and equip member-world forces.
- @exercise: Hold joint command exercises.
- @defensive: Keep the Pact strictly defensive and transparent.
- @talks: Hold preliminary talks among member worlds.
- @easy_discard

@form
view-if: not pact_formed
subtitle: −2 political capital. A milestone, and a provocation.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2; pact_formed = 1; member_forces += 1.5; hawk_strength += 4; hawk_dissent -= 6; pacifist_dissent += 5; sec_relation += 4; core_pal += 0.5; colonies_pal += 0.5
achievement: defence_pact

In a modest ceremony on Chandrila, eleven member worlds sign the Free Worlds Defence Pact. [? if pal_chancellor : The Chancellor's office expresses "concern at the creation of private armies within the Republic". ?]

@train
view-if: pact_formed and member_forces < 8
subtitle: −2 political capital. +1 member-world forces.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2; member_forces += 1; hawk_dissent -= 3; pacifist_dissent += 2; fear += 0.5

CorSec instructors and Alderaanian quartermasters work through the night.

@exercise
view-if: pact_formed and member_forces < 8
subtitle: +0.5 member-world forces; the Hawks are pleased.
on-arrival: member_forces += 0.5; hawk_dissent -= 4; sec_relation += 2

Pact squadrons fly joint exercises above Corellia. The HoloNet loves the footage.

@defensive
view-if: pact_formed
subtitle: Reassures the Senate and the Pacifists.
on-arrival: pacifist_dissent -= 5; faith += 0.5; ind_relation += 3

The Pact publishes its rules of engagement in full: it will act only in defence of member worlds and of the Senate itself.

@talks
view-if: not pact_formed
subtitle: Free. Lays the groundwork.
on-arrival: member_forces += 0.2; hawk_dissent -= 2

Defence ministers from a dozen worlds meet quietly on Corellia.
